<title>AUSTRALIA: WMC says Kalgoorlie nickel smelter back up.</title>
<headline>WMC says Kalgoorlie nickel smelter back up.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian miner WMC Ltd said on Wednesday its Kalgoorlie nickel smelter in Western Australia had resumed production after repairs to the furnace.</p>
<p>The smelter is operating at 80 percent capacity and is expected to be back to full production by Friday, it said.</p>
</text>
